# Netlify redirects. Rules are matched top to bottom.

# The old hyltansmetall.se addresses, so links and search results pointing at
# them land on the matching new page (301 = moved for good, which also tells
# Google to move the ranking over). /specialtillverkning kept its address.
/om-foretaget      /om-oss          301
/tillverkningen    /tillverkning    301

# Every other address is served the app, which routes it itself. Without this,
# opening /om-oss directly or refreshing a subpage gives a 404. Real files
# (robots.txt, sitemap.xml, /assets/...) are served before this rule applies.
/*    /index.html    200
